[Tricks "trap,pin"]
[Refutes "1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. cxd5 exd5 6. Nxd5"]

1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. cxd5 exd5 6. Nxd5? { The knight on f6 looks pinned, so d5 looks free. It
is not. } 6... Nxd5! 7. Bxd8 Bb4+ { Check, so White has no time to save the bishop. } 8. Qd2 Bxd2+ 9. Kxd2 Kxd8
{ Black is a piece for a pawn up. } *
